        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>11-13/16 Inch Long Stainless Steel Flush Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 11-13/16\" long sliding door flush pull has very clean lines. Concealed mounting holes add to the clean contemporary styling. Packaged with stainless steel mounting screws for easy installation. This rectangular flush pull is for use on pocket doors, sliding doors, cabinet doors, or any door where a \"flush with the door face\" pull is desired. Available in your choice of Satin Stainless Steel, Polished Stainless Steel or Matte Black finish. The finger opening has a nice easy grab lip. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DWD-718-300_size.gif?v=1704354563\" width=\"600\" height=\"500\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Long Stainless Steel Flush Pull  Dimensions\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/15-3-4-inch-extra-long-stainless-steel-flush-pull\"><b>15-3/4 Inch Extra Long Stainless Steel Flush Pull</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/7-7-8-inch-stainless-steel-flush-pull\"><b>7-7/8 Inch Stainless Steel Flush Pull</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Long Stainless Steel Flush Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Height: 11-13/16\" (300 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Total Width: 2-3/16\" (56 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Total Depth: 1/2\" (13 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Depth: 7/16\" (11 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1/16\" (2 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Finger Opening Height: 10-5/8\" (270 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Finger  Opening Width: 1-1/32\" (26 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Height: 11-9/16\" (294 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Width: 1-15/16\" (50 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually</b>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "11-13/16 Inch Long Stainless Steel Flush Pull",
                "description": "The 11-13/16 inch long sliding door flush pull has very clean lines. Concealed mounting holes add to the clean contemporary styling. Packaged with stainless steel mounting screws for easy installation. This rectangular flush pull is for use on pocket doors, sliding doors, cabinet doors, or any door where a flush with the door face pull is desired. Available in your choice of Satin Stainless Steel, Polished Stainless Steel or Matte Black finish. The finger opening has a nice easy grab lip. ",
